## Decisions Made

- **Anchor UX = converge to normal references, not invent new** (Director directive). Anchors are paired start/end for video continuity (TD-49); their divergent drawer was a regression. Fix = write image_prompt on anchors + Plan-fallback. Anchor Chain is a per-episode TOGGLE in Episode Settings (off = proven normal-ref flow).
- **Budget cap set by Director via UI**, not agent script (classifier-aligned). Cascade intent: config default → series episode_budget_ceiling → episode override at brief-approval (the proper gate; currently only series-inheritance exists, which is why S15 was null).
- **Concurrency lever, not "Polina parallelism"** — fan-out is already automatic; cap is Inngest config + provider RPM. Bumped 2→4; Inngest retries:2+backoff cover transient 429s. Rollback to 3 if sustained 429s.
- **Tools live under webapp/tools/** (not scripts/) to dodge the over-broad naming hook.
- **Orchestrate big work with parallel subagents/workflows** (Director reminder) — demonstrated with the 3-agent review.

